      "value": "Still an issue in build 1472, if you check for player position OnPlayerJoined, it is always at 0,0,0. Locally when OnPlayerJoined the position is correctly at spawn.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n1. Make a UdonBehaviour that uses VRCPayerApi.GetPosition() in OnPlayerJoined()\n\n2. Observe its value is always 0,0,0 for Remote users\n\nEDIT: Moved to a new post https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1472-vrcpayerapigetposition-is-0-0-0-for-late-joiners-when-accessed-onplayerjoin",
